{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18d3_level_act18d3_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act18d3",
  "stageId": "act18d3_06",
  "title": "厌食",
  "storyCode": "SV-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b886ad810ff4702c836ca781d1f788a2c2f829b3f79af36d99e461af53666ca8",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "没有尽头......浓雾弥漫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哼哼~哼......♪",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你醒啦！早上好啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "谁在唱歌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这、这是歌吗？我不会唱。你睡着的时候，嘴里总在哼着这几句哩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哎哟！歌手你......你抓我抓得太用力啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "妈妈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怪物......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怪物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怪物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咳咳......歌手，你的箱子......压得我胸口好疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "松、松手了？刚才吓死我了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，我还以为你想杀了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我是可以杀死你。很简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "但你不想杀我呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "可是，我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "诶？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "又、又来？突然就冲了出去......歌手，你要去哪里啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "......长官，快涨潮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "海的颜色......那一块颜色变了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "水里有什么东西......是、是贝壳和鳞类？为什么海水里突然有这些？而且还在不断向岸边靠近？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "沿着不该存在的洋流，从更深处来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "我还以为......他们去海里，宣称这能换来吃的，只是一种荒诞的迷信。我以为，他们是在绝望之中受人蛊惑，胡言乱语......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "没想到，他们、他们竟然真的与大海交易？他们把自己人当作饵料，喂养大海里的怪物，然后怪物也喂食他们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "这可怕的畸形的共生关系......难怪，这里的恐鱼会有这么多！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "可是昨天......昨天我以为我阻止了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "不是所有的纠正都有结果，你该学到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "是我错了么，长官？我只是想救他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "要纠正一处错的，要么使错的走回正道——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "可是......对他们来说，什么是正道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "盐风城......这片土地和海岸，再也无法孕育任何食物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "结局早在几十年前便已注定，一切挣扎都是徒劳，移动城市、文明和这里的人，都在慢性死亡的路上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "他们问我。如果......如果已经无路可走，如何才能分清对错？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "——又或者使错的不存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "长官......！您的意思是要我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "你在怀疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "我......不，我不敢。我只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "虽然他们......现在变成了这样。他们也曾经是伊比利亚的居民。我想保护他们，我希望我能使这里的人......使这个国家变好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "你该怀疑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "要作出判决，你需靠你自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "是，长官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "看看这片海。你看到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "是......威胁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "不要背诵答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "是，长官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "海水在......流动。在不断地变化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "记住你看到的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "变化已然、正在、将要发生。如果无法看得更清楚，你将会迷失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "长官，您脚下是？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "你认为呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "一只恐鱼......是晚上攻击街道的漏网之鱼？！不，好像不是......这一只在海岸上徘徊......它爬了好长的一段路......不大一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "是......我，呃，我应该知道......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大审判官",
      "text": "是必须净化的邪恶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "......我明白了。我看清了......交易的全貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "原来，走进海里的人会变成这副样子……这里不仅仅是怪物的巢穴，还是温床。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "这么说的话，这里的所有人都会变成怪物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "（握紧剑鞘）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "审判官",
      "text": "长官，我再回城一趟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呼......呼呼......歌、歌手......你跑得太快了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "看来还不够快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "又让你追了上来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哈......哈哈......歌手，这里可是我家......我对这个地方，可比你熟多啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我该走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "离开这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦，你知道去哪里找你的同伴了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......至少，离你们远一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "啊？为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "那个审判官，她有一件事说得很对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "她话说挺多的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "对你们来说，我很危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "因为昨天晚上的事？你救了我们呀，歌手，我们都很感谢你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "救了你们？你是这么觉得的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "如果，那些恐鱼，有一只我没有杀掉。它可能就会在行进的路上，将你绞碎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你会被它杀死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "它是我带来的，所以你是被我杀死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "不，不是这样的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "怎么不是？这样的事，不是没发生过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "他们因我而死。他们恨我，怕我，责怪我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "那是......他们不对！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这又不是歌手故意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不是故意的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "在那之后......我就不知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我以为，杀掉它，我会有答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手......你的脸色好差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你刚受伤，还消耗了那么多体力，还没有完全恢复吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你还是跟我回去好好休息，等再睡一觉，你会好些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你为什么不怕我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你奶奶叫我怪物。你的同伴看我的眼神充满了敌意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "到哪里......都是这种眼神。我早就习惯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你呢？在你眼里，我是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你是......你是歌手呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "歌手。我说了，你就信。那个审判官就不信。现在我说我是怪物，你信不信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......不信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你到底为什么老跟着我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我能给的东西都可以给你。你却不要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你也不是想杀了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "杀、杀你？不，歌手，我怎么会有这种想法？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我做事，你给报酬。或者相反。陆上的人都是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "交换，就会有约定。有约定，才有信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "约定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你不知道什么是约定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "（摇头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你听好。我说的，你帮了我，我会给你你想要的。这就是约定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......我什么都不要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "说谎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "猎......我的鼻子和眼睛一样灵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你说，这是你家，所以你能很快找到这里来。你也在说谎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你不说实话，我就不会信你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "不，歌手，你不要走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我没有不说实话。我只是......不明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你对我们......对我来说是一个谜。你是外面来的人，我从来没见过你这样的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你想知道，我为什么猜到你在这里，我不是不说实话，我是......不好意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这里是......边缘。离城区最远。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我明白你在躲着我们。我想，你要走的话，你大概也会来这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "也？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我经常偷偷来这里。当然，瞒着铁皮他们。他们发现我总跑这么远，会不高兴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "你看那一块，很高。我有时候会爬上去。因为风更大，我能看得更远。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你好奇外面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我不知道。我......我有时候会想外面是什么样子的。这很没意义，我懂，他们都这么说，所以我只敢一个人偷偷想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我出去捡东西的时候，最远也就走到这里。再外面......外面没有什么有用的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "好奇的话，再走远一些就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "以前我去最西边，铁皮会威胁我。他说外面都是怪物，我们一出去就会死掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，你是从外面来的。我跟着你，其实我有许许多多问题......我想知道，铁皮他说的是真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "或许。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "去外面的话，你会死掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呼......原来是真的啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你并没有失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手，我想，有机会的话，我要去看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "就算有怪物也没啥......我好像并没有那么怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "审判官说，我不怕怪物，是因为我不知道怪物会对我做什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我觉得她说的对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "她胡扯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我也不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哈哈......那是因为，歌手你知道，在你面前，怪物什么都做不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我不一样。昨天夜里，我第一次看清楚了那些怪物。我不知道我会怎样，我的心脏怦怦直跳，跳得从来没有那么——剧烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "再后来，今天早上我醒过来，我竟然发现这天气从未感受过的美好。我能感到风在流动，看到海浪在靠近。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这样的一天，和过去的每一天都不一样。就因为我不知道可能会发生什么，而不是一眼从天亮望到天黑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你很亢奋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "这是亢奋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "害怕，亢奋。没什么差别。都是心跳加快，血液变热。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我是病了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "这不是病。对有些人来说，这是活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "原来活着的感觉这么好。外面的日子，是不是每一天都能这样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "总比这里强些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......我真的可以到外面去吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我的盒子......等我的盒子装满。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我要......多攒些食物。我要安顿好佩特拉奶奶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我......哎呦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "这么不小心的话，是会被怪物吃掉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "歌手......你又救了我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......要是你不跑来的话，就不会这么多事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "哈哈......抱、抱歉啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？咦咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "我的腿......好像有什么东西抓着我的腿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "滑、滑滑的......好重！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......又来了。到处都是。烦人的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "呜......歌手，我、我快抓不住你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "闭上眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "然后松手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安妮塔",
      "text": "......可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "要不要信我，你可以选。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
